std-doc's in-page feedback widget — the part that lets a reader select a
sentence, leave a comment, and watch the page answer back — is BUILT ON Paras
Chopra's make-pages-interactive. We forked his proven core (snapshot-on-
selection, the multi-tier anchor fallback, the liveness-aware "is anyone home"
timer) and grew it from there. The files derived from his work are:

    go/stddoc-lib/lib/feedback.js   ·   go/stddoc-lib/lib/feedback.css
    (the std-doc skill ships byte-identical copies of the same files)

